Third-party components
----------------------

No third-party source code is vendored into this repository. Dependencies are
consumed as unmodified packages, and the exact pinned set is
requirements.lock.txt.

A built artifact that bundles those packages (for example the container image)
is a copy of them as well, so their licence texts and notices travel with it.

Medical NER, PII detection and deidentification use OpenMed, by Maziyar Panahi,
licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0:
https://github.com/maziyarpanahi/openmed
